    <notepad>
      <note>DFT-load_ods_drugs_hospital3
Hospital 3 drug prescriptions: sta.sta_drugs_hospital3 -&gt; ods.drug. Run by WF-load_ods, which empties ods.drug first.
1. NUL: the text NULL becomes empty
2. LKP: code system of each coded column, from ods.source_code_system
3. DCNV: ODS names and types
4. DB_DST: insert into ods.drug
Red hops: rows DCNV cannot convert, and rows ods.drug refuses, go to adm.ods_load_reject.</note>
